3. ASSASSINATION / HISTORICAL EVENT (Indira Gandhi, Modi attempts, JFK-style)
   — Hero = bodyguard / investigator / decision-maker
   — "Climax" = the killing / the saving moment

4. ESCAPE / SURVIVAL (Pakistan jail break, IC-814 hijack, Iran rescue)
   — Hero = prisoner / pilot / hostage / negotiator
   — "Closed-room" = control room / war room
   — "Final execution night" = the escape attempt itself

5. SCAM / CORRUPTION INVESTIGATION (Jal Jeevan Mission, 2G, telecom fraud)
   — Hero = journalist / whistleblower / auditor / agency
   — Villain = corrupt nexus / system; "Operation" = investigation timeline
