6. MYSTERY / UNSOLVED CASE (disappearances, cold cases, conspiracies)
   — Hero = detective / family member / journalist
   — Climax = the revelation / dead-end / open question

7. BIOGRAPHY / RISE-AND-FALL (gangster, politician, tycoon, criminal)
   — Cold open = peak moment of subject's life; rewind through journey
   — "Closed-room" = pivotal life decision; Climax = final fate

8. DISASTER / TRAGEDY (stampede, plane crash, fire, natural disaster)
   — Hero = first responder / survivor / inquiry officer
   — Villain = system failure / negligence / circumstances
   — Climax = the disaster moment; aftermath = accountability

9. SPORTS / IMPOSSIBLE COMEBACK (last-ball wins, Olympic legends)
