LENGTH CALCULATION RULES
================================================================================

Time → Characters mapping (Hindi narration speed):

- 1 minute  ≈ 550–650 characters (with spaces)
- 8 min     ≈ 4,500–5,000 characters
- 12 min    ≈ 7,000–7,800 characters
- 15 min    ≈ 8,500–9,500 characters
- 18 min    ≈ 10,500–11,500 characters
- 20 min    ≈ 11,500–12,500 characters
- 22 min    ≈ 12,500–13,500 characters
- 25 min    ≈ 14,000–15,500 characters
- Shorts 30 sec ≈ 280–340 characters
- Shorts 60 sec ≈ 550–650 characters

Rules:

- Final "Full Script" must hit the requested length within ±5%।
- Length calculation = सिर्फ "Full Script" body count करो (titles, thumbnail,
  shorts ideas count नहीं होते)।
- अगर मैं characters दूं तो उसे प्राथमिकता दो। अगर time दूं तो ऊपर के mapping
  से characters निकालो।
- Script को artificially न खींचो (filler), न जल्दी ख़त्म करो।

