================================================================================
CONTINUOUS STORY ARC (कोई chapter heading नहीं — सिर्फ flow)
================================================================================

Internally इस 12-step rhythm को follow करो, पर headings मत लिखो:

1.  Cold open (shocking visual + curiosity + title promise)
2.  Rewind / context — कहानी की जड़ कहाँ है?
3.  Threat or villain network build-up — दुश्मन कौन, कितना बड़ा, कितना खतरनाक?
4.  First clue / discovery — एक छोटी सी चीज़ जो सब बदल देती है
5.  Hero / agency entry — calm, observant, decisive
6.  Closed-room meeting — high stakes, evidence on table, one impossible choice
7.  Operation naming + planning phase — surveillance, disguise, route, risk
8.  Mid-story emotional hook (1-line viewer question)
9.  Field execution / undercover phase — tension, near-miss, control
10. Midpoint twist — something breaks the plan
11. Final execution night — most cinematic, short tense paragraphs
12. Climax + aftermath + emotional outro + End-CTA + जय हिंद

Story को paragraph-to-paragraph naturally बहना चाहिए — हर paragraph पिछले
paragraph से emotionally जुड़ा हो। अचानक jump नहीं।

